WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.336
-The President's allies
are flailing

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:06.305
as they try to defend him
in both the impeachment inquiry

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:07.807
and the controversy

00:00:07.807 --> 00:00:10.143
over his decision
to abandon the Kurds.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:13.613
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:16.850
♪♪

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.284
As he faces an intensifying

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:20.153
impeachment inquiry
in the House,

00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:23.223
the President is also dealing
with nearly unanimous backlash

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:25.191
from both Republicans
and Democrats

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.327
over his decision to abandon
our Kurdish allies in Syria

00:00:28.327 --> 00:00:30.630
who helped American soldiers
fight ISIS.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.099
And, yet, even after being
accused of a tragic betrayal

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:35.534
by our Kurdish allies,
yesterday, Trump patted himself

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:37.770
on the back during a speech
in which he announced

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.905
that he was lifting sanctions
on Turkey.

00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:44.010
-Today's announcement validates
our course of action...

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.445
with...Turkey...

00:00:46.445 --> 00:00:50.717
that only a couple of weeks ago
was scorned,

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.620
and now people are saying, "Wow.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.889
What a great outcome.
Congratulations."

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:59.792
-No one is saying that.

00:00:59.792 --> 00:01:02.161
But if they did,
judging from your cadence,

00:01:02.161 --> 00:01:05.432
they were super-high.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.032
"Wow."

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:10.035
He sounds like
a local mattress salesman.

00:01:10.035 --> 00:01:13.072
"Wow. What a great deal."

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:16.175
Second, any time Trump
says "people are saying,"

00:01:16.175 --> 00:01:17.710
those people do not exist.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.713
Trump uses "people are saying"
the same way guys use

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.248
"my friend has a problem"

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.851
when they ask their doctors
for Cialis.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.085
Trump says he doesn't think

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:27.887
we should be fighting wars
in the Middle East,

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.655
but let's just be clear
about something --

00:01:29.655 --> 00:01:31.223
Donald Trump has not
and has never been

00:01:31.223 --> 00:01:32.458
an anti-war president.

00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:34.360
He just pretends to be one.
All he cares about

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.262
is what you can do for him
personally.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.564
And reporters who actually
talked to the Kurds

00:01:38.564 --> 00:01:41.234
on the ground yesterday
confirmed that they definitely

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:44.036
were not saying, "Wow.
What a great outcome."

00:01:44.036 --> 00:01:46.172
-They're not listening
to President Trump anymore.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:49.275
He has totally
broken their trust.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:52.211
They think that President Trump
has betrayed them

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.046
and that he is
effectively a joke,

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:55.681
that he doesn't keep his word.

00:01:55.681 --> 00:01:58.317
The one people they did trust
was the United States,

00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:00.620
but now U.S. troops
have been forced to leave.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.956
They're seeing signs from
the Kurds saying, "We love you.

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:07.327
We still appreciate the role
that you, the U.S. troops, did,

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:09.528
but your president betrayed us."

00:02:09.528 --> 00:02:11.697
-And that's what Trump does.
He betrays everybody.

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:14.000
It doesn't matter who you are
or what you do for him.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.369
As soon as you're not useful
to him, he'll discard you.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.604
I mean, just look
how many of his former aides

00:02:18.604 --> 00:02:20.540
he's attacked
or thrown under the bus.

00:02:20.540 --> 00:02:24.877
In fact, I'm pretty sure Steve
Bannon still lives under one.

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:27.646
And just take Rudy Giuliani,
Trump's personal lawyer

00:02:27.646 --> 00:02:30.582
and perhaps his most vocal
and consistent defender.

00:02:30.582 --> 00:02:32.986
After two of Rudy's associates,
Lev and Igor,

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:35.221
were arrested,
and it was reported --

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:37.690
that's their real names --
it was reported

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:41.327
that Rudy, himself, was under
criminal investigation,

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.196
here's what Trump had to say

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:46.032
about his longtime relationship
with his friend and ally.

00:02:46.032 --> 00:02:48.735
-Is Rudy Giuliani still
your personal attorney?

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:51.304
-Well, I don't know.
I haven't spoken to Rudy.

00:02:51.304 --> 00:02:53.172
I spoke to him
yesterday briefly.

00:02:53.172 --> 00:02:54.873
He's a very good attorney.

00:02:54.873 --> 00:02:56.776
And he has been my attorney.
Yeah, sure.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:03:01.014
You know -- You know it's bad
when you keep changing tenses.

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:02.615
"Was he my lawyer? I don't know.

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.950
Is he?
I mean, yeah, he has been.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:08.154
Will he be in the future?
Yeah. Sure."

00:03:08.154 --> 00:03:10.089
But this is what Trump does.

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:12.291
The minute you're a burden
on him, he'll dump you.

00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:14.426
In fact, now that Rudy is under
criminal investigation,

00:03:14.426 --> 00:03:18.131
Trump makes him sit outside when
they fly on "Air Force One."

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.465
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.465 --> 00:03:20.933
Because Trump in his essence,

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:22.635
everything with him
is a transaction.

00:03:22.635 --> 00:03:24.003
The Trump who betrays his allies

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.904
as soon as they're
no longer useful for him

00:03:25.904 --> 00:03:28.040
is also the same guy
who tried to orchestrate

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.809
a corrupt quid pro quo
with Ukraine

00:03:29.809 --> 00:03:31.744
for his own personal
political benefit.

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:33.612
This behavior is obviously
corrupt and illegal,

00:03:33.612 --> 00:03:35.181
and we already have
all the evidence.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.282
In fact, Trump and his aides

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:37.850
have basically confessed
to all of it.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.919
So Republicans are running
out of ways to defend it.

00:03:39.919 --> 00:03:42.121
For example, earlier this month,
Trump insisted

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.156
that Senate Majority Leader
Mitch McConnell

00:03:44.156 --> 00:03:46.492
had personally assured him
that his phone call

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.228
with the president of Ukraine,
in which he famously said

00:03:49.228 --> 00:03:52.165
the words, "I would like you
to do us a favor," was perfect.

00:03:52.165 --> 00:03:54.634
-I read Mitch McConnell's
statement yesterday,

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:58.071
and he read my phone call,
and as you know,

00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.772
he put out a statement that said

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:02.708
that was the most innocent
phone call he's read.

00:04:02.708 --> 00:04:04.911
And I spoke to him
about it, too.

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:08.314
He read my phone call with
the president of Ukraine,

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:11.684
Mitch McConnell. He said,
"That was the most innocent

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:13.286
phone call."

00:04:13.286 --> 00:04:15.054
-Once again, he can't even mimic

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:18.490
actual human syntax
when he lies.

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.792
No human talks like that.

00:04:19.792 --> 00:04:22.094
And for our purposes,
just go along with the idea

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:24.830
that Mitch McConnell is a human,
even though he is clearly

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.467
at least 60% dried apple doll.

00:04:27.467 --> 00:04:29.569
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:32.004
Seriously, just imagine...
Just imagine...

00:04:32.004 --> 00:04:33.639
if you can,

00:04:33.639 --> 00:04:36.775
the most innocent phone call
you've ever witnessed.

00:04:36.775 --> 00:04:39.545
You've never watched your spouse
order takeout and said,

00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:41.513
"Wow, honey.
That was the most innocent

00:04:41.513 --> 00:04:42.915
phone call I've ever seen.

00:04:42.915 --> 00:04:45.751
You ordered that pizza
without murdering anyone."

00:04:45.751 --> 00:04:48.353
But, still, Trump said
he spoke to McConnell

00:04:48.353 --> 00:04:50.455
and McConnell told him
it was an innocent phone call.

00:04:50.455 --> 00:04:51.691
There's just one problem.

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:54.093
McConnell doesn't seem
to remember it that way.

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:58.397
-The President has said that
you told him that his phone call

00:04:58.397 --> 00:05:01.400
with the Ukrainian president
was perfect and innocent.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.269
Do you believe
that the President

00:05:03.269 --> 00:05:05.404
has handled this
Ukrainian situation perfectly?

00:05:05.404 --> 00:05:07.607
-We've not had any conversations
on that subject.

00:05:07.607 --> 00:05:10.343
-So he was lying about that?
-You'll have to ask him.

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.411
I don't recall any conversations

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:14.747
with the President
about that phone call.

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:17.483
-Wow. Even Mitch McConnell
won't back him up now.

00:05:17.483 --> 00:05:20.219
By the end of this whole thing,
Republicans are just going to

00:05:20.219 --> 00:05:22.822
start pretending they don't even
know who Donald Trump is.

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:25.691
"Uh, that man
was the president?

00:05:25.691 --> 00:05:28.427
I just assumed he was
a Halloween decoration

00:05:28.427 --> 00:05:32.265
meant to scare away pranksters
on mischief night."

00:05:32.265 --> 00:05:35.167
Problem for the Republicans
is that the facts are so clear

00:05:35.167 --> 00:05:37.937
that there's nothing they can
say or do to defend them.

00:05:37.937 --> 00:05:41.140
For example, those words Trump
said on the phone call,

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:43.442
"I would like you
to do us a favor,"

00:05:43.442 --> 00:05:46.578
would seem like a classic
quid pro quo, but this week,

00:05:46.578 --> 00:05:48.147
Trump booster Sean Hannity

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:50.449
tried out a new,
even dumber defense.

00:05:50.449 --> 00:05:52.885
"It's not a crime because
that's just how Trump talks."

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.586
-By the way,
it's important to remember

00:05:54.586 --> 00:05:56.589
one more thing about
the President's phone call

00:05:56.589 --> 00:05:58.891
with Ukraine,
and the President said,

00:05:58.891 --> 00:06:01.160
"I'd like you to do us a favor."

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.497
Okay. It's a favor. Okay.
There were no strings attached.

00:06:04.497 --> 00:06:06.532
Zero quid pro quo.

00:06:06.532 --> 00:06:09.602
And let's be clear --
the term, "do us a favor,"

00:06:09.602 --> 00:06:12.170
well, we all have go-to phrases.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:14.707
You know.
I say "you know" a lot.

00:06:14.707 --> 00:06:17.509
The President uses them
all the time.

00:06:17.509 --> 00:06:19.679
-That's your argument?

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:22.414
That saying "do us a favor"
to a foreign leader

00:06:22.414 --> 00:06:25.684
is equivalent to you saying
"you know"?

00:06:25.684 --> 00:06:28.554
"You have to understand,
Trump says 'do us a favor'

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:30.656
the way Valley girls say 'like'

00:06:30.656 --> 00:06:32.891
or how Jesse Pinkman
says 'bitch' all the time.

00:06:32.891 --> 00:06:35.661
It doesn't mean he's a criminal.
That's just how he talks.

00:06:35.661 --> 00:06:38.364
Also, he's a criminal."

00:06:38.364 --> 00:06:40.299
Republicans
have also tried insisting

00:06:40.299 --> 00:06:43.202
that there was no quid pro quo
because the "quo" in this case

00:06:43.202 --> 00:06:45.571
would be the military aid
Trump was holding up,

00:06:45.571 --> 00:06:47.874
and it would only be
a quid pro quo if Ukraine

00:06:47.874 --> 00:06:49.575
knew that aid was being delayed.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.476
Here's one
Republican Congressman

00:06:51.476 --> 00:06:53.813
responding to shocking testimony
from a key witness

00:06:53.813 --> 00:06:56.182
in the impeachment inquiry
this week on Fox News.

00:06:56.182 --> 00:06:59.618
-Neither he or any other witness
has provided testimony that the

00:06:59.618 --> 00:07:03.789
Ukrainians were aware that
military aid was being withheld.

00:07:03.789 --> 00:07:06.392
You can't have a quid pro quo
with no "quo."

00:07:06.392 --> 00:07:07.860
-That's how dumb these guys are.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.962
They've gone from
"There was no quid pro quo"

00:07:09.962 --> 00:07:12.899
to "There was a quid pro
but no 'quo.'"

00:07:12.899 --> 00:07:14.267
Soon, they're going to try,

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:16.135
"There was a 'quid,'
and there was a 'quo,'

00:07:16.135 --> 00:07:18.904
but we are definitely not pros."

00:07:18.904 --> 00:07:21.140
But then that argument also --

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.976
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:23.976 --> 00:07:26.746
It also fell through
when it was reported

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:29.214
that Ukraine did know
the aid was being held up.

00:07:29.214 --> 00:07:32.051
So then Trump's allies tried
yet another new argument --

00:07:32.051 --> 00:07:34.487
"it might have been wrong,
but it wasn't a crime."

00:07:34.487 --> 00:07:37.056
Here's Trump's former acting
attorney general Matt Whitaker

00:07:37.056 --> 00:07:39.124
making that argument on Fox News
this week.

00:07:39.124 --> 00:07:40.626
Again, this is a man

00:07:40.626 --> 00:07:43.162
who was in charge
of the Justice Department.

00:07:43.162 --> 00:07:45.664
-I'm a former prosecutor,
and what I know

00:07:45.664 --> 00:07:48.167
is this is a perfect time
for preliminary hearing

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:50.469
where you would say,
"Show us your evidence.

00:07:50.469 --> 00:07:52.371
What evidence of a crime
do you have?"

00:07:52.371 --> 00:07:53.739
I mean, the Constitution --

00:07:53.739 --> 00:07:56.442
You know, sort of abuse of power
is not a crime.

00:07:56.442 --> 00:07:58.644
-Yeah, it is.

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:01.013
Also, you look like
Abuse of Power

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:03.582
should be your wrestling name.

00:08:03.582 --> 00:08:07.453
"Please welcome to the ring
Abuse of Power!"

00:08:07.453 --> 00:08:09.287
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:08:09.287 --> 00:08:12.391
"He's ripping up
the Constitution!"

00:08:12.391 --> 00:08:14.693
So because they've totally
run out of arguments,

00:08:14.693 --> 00:08:16.929
Republicans have now been
reduced to physically

00:08:16.929 --> 00:08:18.764
obstructing
the impeachment inquiry.

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:21.500
For example, yesterday, we told
you that House Republicans

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.902
had orchestrated the dumb stunt
in which they held

00:08:23.902 --> 00:08:25.904
a press conference
and then stormed into

00:08:25.904 --> 00:08:28.407
a secure hearing room
in order to interfere

00:08:28.407 --> 00:08:30.042
with the deposition.
The Congressman who led

00:08:30.042 --> 00:08:33.145
the stunt, Matt Gaetz,
compared it to the movie "300."

00:08:33.145 --> 00:08:35.681
Now, in case you forgot,
here's what that movie was like.

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:38.517
-This is Sparta!

00:08:38.517 --> 00:08:42.021
-Okay, so now let's see those
Republicans storm the hearing

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:45.324
in the way they described
was like the movie "300."

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:47.693
-We're going to go and see
if we can get inside.

00:08:47.693 --> 00:08:50.162
-Let's do it.
-So let's see if we can get in.

00:08:50.162 --> 00:08:52.298
[ Laughter ]

00:08:52.298 --> 00:08:55.101
-We're going in.

00:08:55.101 --> 00:08:57.803
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.803 --> 00:09:00.473
-"This is Sparta!

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:03.743
So..."

00:09:03.743 --> 00:09:05.644
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.644 --> 00:09:09.347
That wasn't "300."
That was, like, "3."

00:09:09.347 --> 00:09:12.217
Makes your publicity stunt
a lot less dramatic

00:09:12.217 --> 00:09:14.019
when you have to shuffle along

00:09:14.019 --> 00:09:16.722
like you're in a crowded mall
at Christmas.

00:09:16.722 --> 00:09:19.024
Look at these guys. They all
look like they're headed

00:09:19.024 --> 00:09:22.161
to the bathroom during an
intermission at a Broadway show.

00:09:22.161 --> 00:09:24.796
So it turns out Trump, himself,
had advanced knowledge

00:09:24.796 --> 00:09:26.532
of this stunt
and approved of it,

00:09:26.532 --> 00:09:29.334
but it turns out the stunt
was even dumber than we thought

00:09:29.334 --> 00:09:31.703
because a lot of those
Republicans were actually

00:09:31.703 --> 00:09:35.040
allowed to be in the room
they were supposedly storming.

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:38.044
-A bunch of them made a big show
of storming the secure facility

00:09:38.044 --> 00:09:39.979
in the Capitol where
impeachment investigators

00:09:39.979 --> 00:09:41.980
are deposing witnesses.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.116
We should note
that some of these folks

00:09:44.116 --> 00:09:46.318
are on the committees
doing the investigating,

00:09:46.318 --> 00:09:49.087
so they don't need to storm the
proceedings because some were

00:09:49.087 --> 00:09:52.157
already allowed inside
and had been inside before.

00:09:52.157 --> 00:09:56.595
-Guys, you can't "storm" a room
you're allowed to be in.

00:09:56.595 --> 00:09:59.999
That's not storming.
That's entering.

00:09:59.999 --> 00:10:02.201
You STORM
the beaches of Normandy.

00:10:02.201 --> 00:10:04.803
You GO to the Jersey shore.

00:10:04.803 --> 00:10:08.373
"We've taken
Point Pleasant, boys!"

00:10:08.373 --> 00:10:10.609
Even Republicans
are having trouble defending

00:10:10.609 --> 00:10:13.345
Trump's corrupt behavior now
because the facts are clear,

00:10:13.345 --> 00:10:15.381
and support for impeachment
is rising in the polls.

00:10:15.381 --> 00:10:17.516
If the House completes
its investigation

00:10:17.516 --> 00:10:20.586
and officially impeaches Trump,
I bet at least a few Americans

00:10:20.586 --> 00:10:22.988
will take a rip off a bong
and say...

00:10:22.988 --> 00:10:27.058
-Wow. What a great outcome.
Congratulations.

00:10:27.058 --> 00:10:29.095
-This has been "A Closer Look."

